      "writtenOn": "2017-06-12T20:30:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is confusingly named.\n\nIt does not, as the name suggests, print version information about the chip.\n\nInstead, it\u0027s a function which prints information about the current firmware, which itself depends on the board configuration, and the implementation is chip-specific.\n\nWould it be clearer to add this information to command_board_id() instead?",
